# Norsk bokmål (Norwegian Bokmål) language pack for MXBMRP3 - BETA.
# Drafted for 1.35; not yet reviewed line by line by a native speaker.
# Corrections are welcome: see README.md in the parent folder.
# Windows reports Norwegian as "nb-NO", which this folder matches.
#
# Glossary (keep these consistent):
#   rider = kjører, bike = sykkel, lap = runde, sector = sektor,
#   split = mellomtid, gap = avstand, PB = PR (personlig rekord),
#   standings = stilling, pits = depot, penalty = straff, session = økt,
#   practice = trening, qualify = kvalifisering, race = løp,
#   settings = innstillinger, hotkeys = hurtigtaster, rumble = vibrasjon,
#   notice = varsel, toast = varselkort, callout = opprop,
#   achievement = prestasjon, profile = profil, crash = krasj,
#   controller = kontroller, race number = startnummer,
#   auto-director = autoregi, web overlay = web-overlegg, On/Off = På/Av,
#   Default = Standard. Ordinals: 1., 2. (FINISHED %d%s).
#   Kept in English as players say them: HUD, Dash, Companion, Gap Bar,
#   Delta Trace, holeshot, whip, scrub, oppo, endo, stoppie, backflip,
#   frontflip, turn down, trick names, FMX, OBS, live, replay, spotter,
#   widget, RPM, Rev, Speedo.
